# Keep LF line endings in the working tree on every OS. Git for Windows checks files out with CRLF
# by default, so a fresh clone there showed every file as modified (the skill's update step stops to
# ask before discarding local changes) and shell and Python scripts failed when run from WSL
# ("python3\r: No such file or directory"). Binary files are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
